<title>LITHUANIA: DRAUDIMAS H1 NET PROFIT 5.7 MLN LITAS.</title>
<headline>DRAUDIMAS H1 NET PROFIT 5.7 MLN LITAS.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1997</p>
<p>				     (million litas unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit			  5.7	   vs  5.1</p>
<p> Premiums			   65.5	   vs 52.7</p>
<p> Income from investments	 6.3	   vs 12.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- Insurance company Lietuvos Draudimas is around 70</p>
<p>percent state-owned. It gave no further details on its</p>
<p>first-half profit.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
